(i)
after clause (22), the following clauses shall be inserted, namely -
"(23) 'agricultural year' means an year which begins from first day of July and ends on thirtieth day of June of a calendar
year. It is also characterised as 'fasli year';
(24)
'intermediary' with reference to any estate means a proprietor, under proprietor, sub-proprietor, thekedar, permanent
